; The residual check reads the same tolerance: with "*:0.5" alone the
; 0.3 USD residual would pass, but the 0.15 USD the cost adds replaces it.
option "inferred_tolerance_default" "*:0.5"
option "infer_tolerance_from_cost" "TRUE"

2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:C

2020-01-02 * "Does not balance"
  Assets:A  1.1 HOOL {3.00 USD}
  Assets:C  -3 USD
